WEBVTT

00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:31.669
vivos,

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:34.049
e, segundo esperamos,

00:12:34.419 --> 00:12:36.140
inspirados.

00:12:36.323 --> 00:12:37.645
Obrigada.

00:12:37.858 --> 00:12:40.878
(Aplausos)

00:12:44.872 --> 00:12:48.043
Música: ("Right on. Be free."
por East Harlem)

00:12:59.994 --> 00:13:03.700
♪ Quero ir onde sopra o vento norte